 by Susan Choi (2019)\\n\\n4. Booker Prize\\n\\nThe Booker Prize (formerly the \\\"Man Booker Prize\\\") was established in 1969. Each year, a panel of judges decide the best novel of ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.tckpublishing.com/prestigious-literature-awards/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d31\"},\"ref\":\"d31\",\"snippet\":\" ... Short-listed for the Booker International Prize, 2005\\n\\n- Banff Centre's National Arts Award, 2005\\n\\n- Edinburgh's International Book Festival Enlightenment Award, 2005\\n\\n- Chicago Tribune Literary Prize, 2005\\n\\n- Markets Initiative Order of the Forest, 2006\\n\\n- Short-listed for Booker International Prize, 2007\\n\\n- Winner Blue Metropolis Literary Grand Prix ... \",\"title\":\"https://margaretatwood.ca/awards-recognitions/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"948980be26f2bb93eaebd95b41b32537f731ca538487f7a3709714278715dfe3\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"000dfd54aa88e5c182282f5800f76fb405dc8bfcb671cee946ac889b91a88c44\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Man Booker International Prize 2019 winner\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_9786c6b064a745beabeaa230"},{"content":"I have a strong lead. Chigozie Obioma was born in Akure, Nigeria. His novels \"The Fishermen\" (2015) and \"An Orchestra of Minorities\" (2019) were shortlisted for the Booker Prize and translated into 30 languages.\n\nBut wait - the Booker Prize was established in 1969, not the 2000s. The puzzle says the award was \"originally created in the 2000s.\" Let me reconsider. The Man Booker International Prize was created in 2005 (2000s). But Obioma's novels were shortlisted for the regular Booker Prize, not the International one.\n\nLet me reconsider the puzzle. Maybe the award is the Man Asian Literary Prize (created 2007). Let me check if Obioma was a contender for that. Or maybe I need to look at this differently - perhaps the \"award created in the 2000s\" is a different award.\n\nLet me search for more details about Obioma's awards and the Man Asian Literary Prize.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Chigozie Obioma Man Asian Literary Prize\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize created 2007 winners\", \"Chigozie Obioma awards nominations full list\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_771279bb96804f9dab9c22c1","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"literary award created 2005 2006 2007 2008 2009 book translated 25 languages\", \"award founded 2000s novel translated over twenty five languages contender\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_aede7cd618504a4095226bf5","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":3000,\"ref\":\"e1\",\"start\":0}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d21\"},\"ref\":\"d21\",\"snippet\":\" ... has published Chigozie Obioma, Monica Ali, Ruth Ozeki, Lauren Groff, Richard Powers, Taylor Jenkins Reid, Amor Towles and Tom Hanks.\\n\\nGuest Speaker\\n\\nBill Clegg is a literary agent in New York and the author of the bestselling memoirs Portrait of an Addict as a Young Man and Ninety ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.oxbelly.com/fiction-writers-program/advisors\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d26\"},\"ref\":\"d26\",\"snippet\":\" ... Coetzee | Slow Man | Secker & Warburg | *John Sutherland (chair) *Lindsay Duguid *Rick Gekoski *Josephine Hart *David Sexton |\\n| 2005 The Booker Prizes |url= |access-date=2022-10-19 |website=thebookerprizes.com |language=en |archive-date=10 December 2022 |archive-url= |url-status=live }} | Longlist | Rachel Cusk | In the Fold | Faber ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_winners_and_nominated_authors_of_the_Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"snippet\":\" ... Chigozie Obioma\\ndate: 2000-01-01\\n---\\n-\\n\\n- MajorsMinorsCertificates\\n\\n>>\\n\\n- Policies & ProceduresFYW Guidebook\\n\\n>>\\n\\n- Digital Learning LabsPortfoliosEvaluationsMoran ePortfolio AwardsBarnett Essay AwardsDouble Dawgs\\n\\n>>\\n\\n- Transfer FAQProspective Student Information\\n\\n>>\\n\\n- Study AbroadInternships and Research Opportunities\\n\\n>>\\n\\n-\\n\\n>>\\n\\n- Double DawgsTransfer Student InformationDual Degree Progra\",\"title\":\"https://www.english.uga.edu/directory/people/chigozie-obioma\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d28\"},\"ref\":\"d28\",\"snippet\":\" ... t the likes of US-based Nigerian Booker Prize shortlistee Chigozie Obioma to take on the mantle of bootstrap race \\\"analysis\\\" in a more sophisticated manner. A few months before the 2016 Aké Festival Black Lives Matter panel, Obioma saw it fit to make his intervention into the ... \",\"title\":\"https://africasacountry.com/2019/04/why-im-no-longer-talking-to-nigerians-about-race\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d30\"},\"ref\":\"d30\",\"snippet\":\" ... This book brilliantly explores the effects of slavery and colonialism on African families as the story unfolds between West Africa and the United States.\\n\\n- The Fishermen (2015) by Chigozie Obioma (Nigeria): In this h